# Pattern: Circuit Breaker

Purpose:
  Prevent cascading failures by tracking failure rates and
  opening circuits when thresholds are exceeded. Ensures system
  can fail fast and recover gracefully.

## Circuit States

CLOSED:
  Normal operation. All requests pass through.
  Transition: -> OPEN after failure_threshold failures

OPEN:
  Circuit is open. All requests fail immediately.
  Transition: -> HALF_OPEN after recovery_timeout

HALF_OPEN:
  Limited requests allowed to test recovery.
  Transition: -> CLOSED after success_threshold successes
  Transition: -> OPEN after failure_threshold failures

## Configuration

Defaults:
  failure_threshold: 3
  recovery_timeout: 60s
  success_threshold: 2
  half_open_max_requests: 5

Per-Stage Configuration:
  P1:
    failure_threshold: 5
    recovery_timeout: 30s
    success_threshold: 3

  D1:
    failure_threshold: 3
    recovery_timeout: 60s
    success_threshold: 2

  S1:
    failure_threshold: 2
    recovery_timeout: 120s
    success_threshold: 2

  C1:
    failure_threshold: 5
    recovery_timeout: 60s
    success_threshold: 3

  R1:
    failure_threshold: 2
    recovery_timeout: 30s
    success_threshold: 1

  DEP1:
    failure_threshold: 1
    recovery_timeout: 300s
    success_threshold: 1

## Failure Detection

Failure Types:
  TIMEOUT: Stage exceeded time limit
  ERROR: Stage returned error
  VALIDATION: Stage output failed validation
  DEPENDENCY: Required dependency failed
  RESOURCE: Out of memory, disk full, etc.

Failure Counting:
  - Consecutive failures tracked per stage
  - Reset on success
  - Window: last 10 attempts

## Circuit Actions

When Circuit Opens:
  1. Log circuit open event
  2. Record failure reason
  3. Notify human if stage is critical
  4. Skip stage if non-critical
  5. Update state: circuit_open

When Circuit Half-Opens:
  1. Allow limited requests
  2. Monitor success/failure
  3. Close if success_threshold met
  4. Re-open if failure_threshold met

When Circuit Closes:
  1. Log circuit close event
  2. Reset failure counter
  3. Resume normal operation

## Fallback Behavior

Per-Stage Fallbacks:
  P1: Return cached prompt analysis or ask human
  D1: Return cached docs or use template defaults
  S1: Return cached .sdd/ state or use template
  C1: Skip code generation, notify human
  R1: Skip review, notify human
  DEP1: Halt deployment, notify human

## Monitoring

Metrics:
  circuit_state: CLOSED|OPEN|HALF_OPEN
  failure_count: integer
  success_count: integer
  last_failure: timestamp
  last_success: timestamp
  recovery_attempts: integer

Alerts:
  Circuit opens: notify human
  Circuit half-opens: log
  Circuit closes: log

State: +
